# 16. Contract testing

Every plugin must pass:

- Manifest schema validation
- API handshake tests
- Lifecycle ordering tests
- Idempotent activation tests
- Shutdown and cancellation tests
- Timeout tests
- Maximum message-size tests
- Permission-denial tests
